{"title":"2012 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>(a) What is the largest factor of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/b/5cb1b41850ab676e4d1cf15c69b1609af4befbc5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$180$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> that is not a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p>(b) If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> satisfies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/3/943153ce52743ea26f8d1d5447a94156a584b210.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^5 \\times 3^2 \\times5^4 \\times 7^3 \\times 11=99000 \\times N$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"281\" height=\"15\" />, \nthen what is the largest perfect square that is a factor of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<pre>(a) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce5d3cbb9ab0a992ed503c2d4499e4f4af2f9d65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> (b) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/f/c5f40cb7585c44d066022164abae4d42af57a926.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$196$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />\n</pre>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/b/64b2f6f4ce90e90850b14e6b2a1c58c48a7d7258.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"22\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><br />\nThe prime factorization of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/b/5cb1b41850ab676e4d1cf15c69b1609af4befbc5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$180$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> is\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/b/cbb2aa0e7b0b70098f1dc2bc9e91ff20619be279.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^2 \\times 3^2 \\times5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"88\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nWe need to get the largest factor of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/b/5cb1b41850ab676e4d1cf15c69b1609af4befbc5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$180$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> which isn't a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, so we can't include both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/9/819068968ed60608a91d0c3921d6296964660e9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"17\" /> is greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so we'll use that and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/a/32a35631e1e126934ead6d2af161e9d250827bbb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^2$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/0/c20c53b03f7d7d921a28b1a0c9bde3fb8ab4137f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\times 3 \\times 2 \\times 2 = \\fbox{\\textbf 36}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"158\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/1/f31dc0a1581ed5f7534c1a90af4b15e05b305ce2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"20\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/3/943153ce52743ea26f8d1d5447a94156a584b210.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^5 \\times 3^2 \\times5^4 \\times 7^3 \\times 11=99000 \\times N$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"281\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/0/2c05c75ee2dd018c81b2a1ca4c45128394df4f45.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^5 \\times 3^2 \\times5^4 \\times 7^3 \\times 11=2^3 \\times 3^2 \\times 5^3 \\times 11 \\times N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"373\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/1/3e1844eee85f5cf74418f9d1d5b8fe2386f44c9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^2 \\times 5 \\times 7^3= N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"129\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><br />\nThe largest square factor of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/a/32a35631e1e126934ead6d2af161e9d250827bbb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^2$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/c/bac4dbe1c696d11e8dc43dd7f613199b2120daa1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\times$\" width=\"11\" height=\"9\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/6/026bb71c09708994ead7a4ee100a03960a87c4f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7^2$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1083c075bc21026e9d9fe1c68e7b7c1ff72430.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{\\textbf 196}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"39\" height=\"24\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_UNCO_Math_Contest_II\" title=\"2012 UNCO Math Contest II\">2012 UNCO Math Contest II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems\" title=\"2012 UNCO Math Contest II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2012 UNCO Math Contest II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://uncmathcontest.wordpress.com/\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2012 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2012 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2012 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2012 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2012 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2012 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2012 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2012 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2012 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2012 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 10\">10</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_Northern_Colorado_Math_Contest\" title=\"University of Northern Colorado Math Contest\"> All UNCO Math Contest Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017230914\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.023 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.038 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 189/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 13